<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Biblica® Open New Luo Translation 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Jo-Galatia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jo-Galatia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jo-Galatia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt1">Jo-Galatia</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1"/>An Paulo, andikonu kaka jaote ma ok oor gi teko kata dwaro mar dhano, to mana gi teko mar Yesu Kristo gi Nyasaye Wuora mane ochiere oa kuom joma otho. <verse eid="GAL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2"/>Andikonu kaachiel gi jowete duto man koda,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GAL 1:2"/>
  <para style="p" vid="GAL 1:2">Un kanisa mar jo-Galatia.<verse eid="GAL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3"/>Ngʼwono kod kwe moa kuom Nyasaye Wuonwa kod Ruodhwa Yesu Kristo, <verse eid="GAL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4"/>Yesu nochiwore nikech richowa mondo ogonywa waa e kethruok mag ndalogi, kaluwore gi dwaro mar Nyasachwa kendo Wuonwa. <verse eid="GAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5"/>Duongʼ mondo odogne Nyasaye manyaka chiengʼ. Amin.<verse eid="GAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s1">Onge Injili machielo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6"/>Awuoro ahinya kaka uselokoru piyo piyo nono, mi uweyo Jal mane oluongou kuom ngʼwono mar Kristo, kendo koro uluwo Injili mopogore gi mane opuonju, <verse eid="GAL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7"/>ma chutho ok en Injili. Kuom adiera nitie jomoko marundo pachu ka gitemo mondo gilok Injili mar Kristo obed gimoro nono. <verse eid="GAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8"/>To ka ngʼato dipuonju Injili machielo mopogore gi mano mane wapuonjou, bed ni en wan, kata malaika moro moa e polo, to mondo okwongʼe nyaka chiengʼ. <verse eid="GAL 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9"/>Mana kaka wasewacho e kaka achako awacho kendo: Ka ngʼato koro yalonu Injili ma opogore gi mane urwako, to Nyasaye mondo okwongʼe nyaka chiengʼ!<verse eid="GAL 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10"/>Uparo ni koro adwaro pak moa kuom dhano? Ooyo, adwaro pak moa kuom Nyasaye. Koso uparo ni atemo moro dhano? Kane bed ni pod ne adwaro moro dhano, to dine ok abedo jatich Kristo.<verse eid="GAL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyasaye oluongo Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11"/>Jowetena, adwaro ni mondo ungʼe ni Injili mane ayalonu ok en gimoro ma dhano ema ochuogo. <verse eid="GAL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12"/>Ne ok ayude kuom dhano moro amora, to bende ne ok opuonjago. Yesu Kristo owuon ema nofwenyona wachno.<verse eid="GAL 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13"/>Nyaka bed ni usewinjo kaka ne achal kane pod aluwo kit lemo mar jo-Yahudi, kaka ne asando kanisa mar Nyasaye gi gero mokalo apima, kendo ne atemo mondo atieke chuth. <verse eid="GAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14"/>Jo-Yahudi mangʼeny ma mbesena ne aloyo kuom lony e kit lemo marwa, kendo ne aketo chunya mar rito chike duto mag kwerena. <verse eid="GAL 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15"/>To ka Nyasaye, mane owala mi oketa tenge kaka gir tichne kane pok onywola, kendo mane oluonga kuom ngʼwonone, nohero <verse eid="GAL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16"/>mondo ofwenyna Wuode, mondo ayal Wach Maber e kind joma ok jo-Yahudi, to ne ok apenjo ngʼato angʼata, <verse eid="GAL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17"/>kendo ne ok adhi Jerusalem mondo ane jogo mane okuongona bedo joote, to ne adhi moriere tir nyaka e piny jo-Arabu eka bangʼe naduogo Damaski.<verse eid="GAL 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18"/>To bangʼ higni adek ne adhi nyaka Jerusalem mondo angʼera gi Petro, kendo ne adak kode kuom ndalo apar gabich. <verse eid="GAL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19"/>Ne ok aneno kata achiel kuom joote mamoko, makmana Jakobo ma owadgi Ruoth. <verse eid="GAL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20"/>Awachonu Adier e nyim Nyasaye ni weche ma andikonugi ok gin miriambo.<verse eid="GAL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21"/>Bangʼe ne adhi e gwenge mag Siria kod Kilikia. <verse eid="GAL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22"/>E kindeno kanisa man Judea moyie kuom Kristo ne pok oyanga malongʼo ni an ngʼa. <verse eid="GAL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23"/>Negisewinjo mana wach niya, “Ngʼat ma yande sandowa bende tinde yalo kuom yie ma notemo ketho e kinde mosekalo.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24"/>Kendo mano nomiyo gimiyo Nyasaye duongʼ nikech an.<verse eid="GAL 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Joote mamoko orwako Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1"/>Bangʼ higni apar gangʼwen ne achako adok Jerusalem, ka wan gi Barnaba kendo Tito bende ne wadhigo. <verse eid="GAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2"/>Ne adhi nikech fweny mane ayudo, ka aketonegi ler kuom Injili mane ayalo ni joma ok jo-Yahudi. To ne atimo mano lingʼ-lingʼ ni jogo mane chalo jotelo, nimar ne aluor ni dipo ka tija mar lando Injili obet kayiem nono. <verse eid="GAL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3"/>To kata Tito, mane ni koda, ne ochun mondo oter nyangu, kata obedo ni ne en ja-Yunani. <verse eid="GAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4"/>Nobet kamano, nikech jomoko mawuondore ni jowete nobiro kanyo lingʼ-lingʼ mondo onon ane thuolo manade ma wan-go kuom bedo jo-Kristo Yesu, nikech jogi ne dwaro lokowa wasumbini. <verse eid="GAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5"/>To ne ok waweyonegi thuolo kata matin, mondo eka adiera mar Injili kik lalnu.<verse eid="GAL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6"/>Ne ok adewo wach jogo mane nenore ka jotelo, nimar ne ok gimiya wach moro manyien nikech Nyasaye ok odewo nenruok ma oko mar dhano. <verse eid="GAL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7"/>Kar timo kamano to negineno ni Nyasaye ne osemiya tich mar yalo Injili ne joma ok jo-Yahudi, mana kaka Petro bende nosemi tich mar yalo ni jo-Yahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8"/>Nikech Nyasaye achiel mane tiyo gi Petro e yalone kaka jaote e kind jo-Yahudi ema bende ne tiyo koda kaka jaote ni joma ok jo-Yahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9"/>Jogo mane ji oyiego kaka sirni, ma gin; Jakobo, Petro kod Johana, noriwa lwedo kaachiel gi Barnaba kane gineno ngʼwono mane omiya. Ne giyie mondo wadhi wayal ni joma ok jo-Yahudi, ka gin to gidhi ir jo-Yahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10"/>Gimoro achiel mane gikwayowa mondo kik wiwa wilgo ne en ni mondo wadhi nyime gi konyo joma odhier, gima an awuon ne aikora timo.<verse eid="GAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okwero Petro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11"/>Kane Petro obiro Antiokia, ne akwere e wangʼe nikech kethone ne nenore ratiro. <verse eid="GAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12"/>Ka jo-Israel moko ne pod ok obiro koa ir Jakobo, Petro ne thoro chiemo gi joma ok jo-Yahudi. To kane gichopo, Petro nongʼwony mi opogore gi joma ok jo-Yahudi nikech ne oluorogi. <verse eid="GAL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13"/>Jo-Yahudi mamoko bende nodonjo kode e wuondruokneno, mi nyaka Barnaba bende noriwore kode e wuondruokno.<verse eid="GAL 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14"/>Kane aneno ni wuondruokgino opogore gi adiera mar Injili, ne awacho ne Petro ka giduto giwinjo niya, “Ka in iwuon in ja-Yahudi, to itimo timbe joma ok jo-Yahudi, koro marangʼo ichuno joma ok jo-Yahudi mondo oluw timbe jo-Yahudi?<verse eid="GAL 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15"/>“Wan wawegi nonywolwa jo-Yahudi to ok joma ok jo-Yahudi ma joricho, <verse eid="GAL 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16"/>wangʼeyo ni dhano ok nyal ket kare kuom mako Chik, to mana kuom yie kuom Yesu Kristo. Omiyo kata mana wan bende waseketo yiewa kuom Kristo Yesu, mondo eka oketwa kare kuom yie kuom Kristo, to ok kuom mako chik, nikech onge ngʼama ibiro ket kare nikech mako chik.<verse eid="GAL 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17"/>“Kapo ni wan mwaseyie kuom Kristo mondo oketwa kare ema pod yudore ni wan joricho, to mano dinyis ni Kristo jiwo richo e ngimawa koso? Ok kamano ngangʼ! <verse eid="GAL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18"/>Ka achako agero gik mane amuko, to mano nyiso malongʼo ni an jaketh chik.<verse eid="GAL 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19"/>“Nikech korka chik to ne asetho kuom chik mondo eka abed mangima ne Nyasaye. <verse eid="GAL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20"/>Osegura kaachiel gi Kristo, kendo an koro ok ema angima, to Kristo ema ngima kuoma. Ngima makoro angimago e ringra an-go mana kuom yie ma ayiego kuom Wuod Nyasaye, mane ohera kendo ochiwore owuon ni an. <verse eid="GAL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21"/>Ok anyal kawo ngʼwono Nyasaye ka gir tugo, nikech ka dipo ni ngima makare inyalo yudo kuom mako Chik, to kare Kristo notho kayiem nono!”<verse eid="GAL 2:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yie kod rito Chik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1"/>Yaye jo-Galatia, mofuwogi! En ngʼa moseirou? Un mane onyisu wach tho mar Yesu Kristo maler mana ka gima ne unene gi wangʼu kigure! <verse eid="GAL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2"/>Adwaro ni unyisa wach achielni kende: Bende ne uyudo Roho Maler kuom rito Chik koso nikech nuyie wach mane uwinjo? <verse eid="GAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3"/>Bende en adier ni ufuwo kamano? Bangʼ chako gi Roho, ere kaka koro unyagoru mar chopo ngima mar Kristo e yor ringruok? <verse eid="GAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4"/>Usesandoru malich kamano mana kayiem adier, ooyo ok apar ni kamano? <verse eid="GAL 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5"/>Bende Nyasaye dimiu Rohone mi otim honnige e dieru nikech urito Chik, koso nikech uyie kuom gik mane uwinjo? <verse eid="GAL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6"/>Paruruane kuom Ibrahim: “Ibrahim noyie kuom Nyasaye kendo mano nomiyo okwane kaka ngʼama kare.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Chak 15:6</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7"/>Wachni puonjo ni joma oyie gin nyithind Ibrahim. <verse eid="GAL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8"/>Nosewach e muma chon ni Nyasaye noket joma ok jo-Yahudi kare kuom yie kendo nolando Injili motelo ni Ibrahim niya, “Ogendini duto nogwedhi nikech in.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Chak 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 18:18">18:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:18">22:18</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9"/>Omiyo joma nigi yie yudo gweth kaachiel gi Ibrahim ngʼat yie.<verse eid="GAL 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10"/>Jogo duto motenore kuom rito Chik ni e bwo kwongʼ, nikech ondiki niya, “Okwongʼ ngʼato ka ngʼato ma ok chop chike duto mondiki e kitap Chik.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">Rap 27:26</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11"/>Nenore malongʼo ni onge ngʼama inyalo keto kare e nyim Nyasaye nikech omako Chik, nikech, “Ngʼat makare nobed mangima kuom yie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Hab 2:4</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12"/>To Chik owuon ok otenore kuom yie, nikech Muma wacho niya, “Ngʼat moluwo chikegi nobed mangima kuomgi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lawi 18:5</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13"/>Kristo to noresowa kuom kwongʼ ma Chik kelo, ka en owuon nobedonwa kaka ngʼama okwongʼ nikech wan, mana kaka ondiki niya, “Okwongʼ ngʼato ka ngʼato molier e yath.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Rap 21:23</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14"/>Noresowa mondo gweth mane Nyasaye omiyo Ibrahim ochop ni joma ok jo-Yahudi kuom Kristo Yesu, mondo kuom yie wan duto wanwangʼ singo mar Nyasaye, ma en Roho Maler.<verse eid="GAL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Chik kod singruok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15"/>Jowetena, we koro alernu tiend wachni ka akonyora gi gima timore pile pile. Wach mwapimoni chalo kama: Ka ji ariyo owinjore e wach moro, to ok oyiene ngʼato badhore ni chopo singruokno kata mondo ngʼato omedie wach moro manyien. <verse eid="GAL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16"/>Singruokgi notimne Ibrahim kod kothe. Ndiko ok owacho gi nyikwaye, tiende ni ji mangʼeny, to mana ni notime gi “kothi”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Chak 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:15">13:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 24:7">24:7</ref></char></char></note> ma en Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17"/>Tiend gima awacho ema: Chik mane Nyasaye ochiwo higni mia angʼwen gi piero adek bangʼe ok nyal ketho winjruok ma Nyasaye nokwongo timo ma mi oketh singruok mane otimo motelo. <verse eid="GAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18"/>Nimar ka Nyasaye miyowa girkeni mana kuom mako Chik, to mano nyiso ni ok wayudgi kuom singruok. To Nyasaye, kuom ngʼwonone, nochiwo gwethne ni Ibrahim kuom singruok.<verse eid="GAL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19"/>To koro ere tij Chik? Chik nomedi mondo onyis dhano kaka en jaketho, nyaka chop kinde ma nyakwar Ibrahim mane osingi nobi. Malaika nokelo Chik moketo e lwet jathek. <verse eid="GAL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20"/>To jathek ok chungʼ kar ngʼat achiel; to Nyasaye to en achiel.<verse eid="GAL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21"/>Wanyalo wacho ni Chik mane Nyasaye ochiwo ogwenyore gi singruok ma notimo gi joge koso? Ooyo, ok nyal bet kamano. Nimar kapo ni Chik mane ochiwno ne nyalo chiwo ngima to mano nyiso ni Chik ne nyalo miyo dhano bedo kare. <verse eid="GAL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22"/>To Muma wacho ratiro ni piny duto ni e twech mar richo omiyo joma oyie kuom Yesu Kristo kende ema yudo gino mane Nyasaye osingo.<verse eid="GAL 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23"/>Kane yie pok obiro, Chik notweyowa waduto, kendo noloronwa yor konyruok, nyaka kinde ma yor yie nofwenyore. <verse eid="GAL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24"/>Omiyo Chik nomi teko mondo oritwa nyaka chop Kristo bi, mondo eka ketwa kare kuom yie. <verse eid="GAL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25"/>To ka koro yie osebiro, to koro ok wan e bwo chik.<verse eid="GAL 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyithind Nyasaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26"/>Un duto un nyithind Nyasaye nikech uyie kuom Kristo Yesu, <verse eid="GAL 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27"/>nimar un duto mosebatisu kuom Kristo userwakoru gi Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28"/>Kuom mano koro onge pogruok e kind ja-Yahudi, kata ja-Yunani; wasumbini kata joma ni thuolo, chwo kata mon. Un duto koro un gimoro achiel ei Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29"/>Omiyo ka un jo-Kristo, to mano nyiso ni un koth Ibrahim, kendo un jocham girkeni ma nosingi.<verse eid="GAL 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1"/>Gima awachonu ema: Ka jacham girkeni pod en nyathi, to oonge pogruok gi misumba, kata obedo ni mwandu duto mar wuon dala osedongʼne. <verse eid="GAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2"/>Ka pod otin, to chune ni nyaka otim gik ma joritne gi jorit mwandu wuon dwaro mondo otim, korito kinde mane wuon-gi ochano mondo jotijego oket mwandu duto e lwete. <verse eid="GAL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3"/>Kamano bende kane pod wan nyithindo, ne oketwa wasumbini mag timbe machon mag piny. <verse eid="GAL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4"/>To ka kinde mane Nyasaye ochano nochopo, to nooronwa Wuode mane dhako onywolo, kendo mane onywol e bwo Chik, <verse eid="GAL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5"/>mondo ores joma Chik otweyo, eka mondo wadok nyithind Nyasaye machamo mwandune. <verse eid="GAL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6"/>To nikech un nyithind Nyasaye, Nyasaye oseoro bende Roho mar Wuode e chunywa. Roho maywakne Nyasaye niya, “<char style="tl">Abba!</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">en dho jo-Hibrania ma tiende ni wuora.</char></note> Wuora.” <verse eid="GAL 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7"/>Omiyo koro ok un wasumbini, to un nyithind ot, to nikech un nyithind ot, Nyasaye osemiyo wadoko jocham girkeni.<verse eid="GAL 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okecho jo-Galatia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8"/>Chon kane pod ukia Nyasaye, ne un wasumbini mag gik ma ok onego kwan kaka nyiseche. <verse eid="GAL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9"/>To ka koro usengʼeyo Nyasaye, kata kawacho e yo machielo maber moloyo ka koro Nyasaye osengʼeyou, to ere kaka uchako udok e timbe machon mag piny, mayom yom kendo maonge teko? Udwaro ni timbegi ochak oketu wasumbini kendo? <verse eid="GAL 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10"/>Uketo chunyu mar rito odiechienge moyiedhi, kod dweche gi ndalo kod higni! <verse eid="GAL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11"/>Ulitna ahinya, kendo timbeu miyo aparo ni dipo nine ayalonu Injili kayiem nono.<verse eid="GAL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12"/>Jowetena, akwayou ni mondo uchal koda, mana kaka an asebedo machal kodu. Pok uchwanya e yo moro amora. <verse eid="GAL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13"/>Ungʼeyo ni e limbena mokwongo tuo mane atuogo ema nomiyo ayudo thuolo mar yalonu Injili. <verse eid="GAL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14"/>To kata obedo ni ne atuo kamano, to ne ok uchaya, kendo ne ok ujara. Kar timo kamano, to ne urwaka gi luor mana ka gima ne urwako malaika mar Nyasaye; chutho ne urwaka mana ka gima ne an Kristo Yesu owuon. <verse eid="GAL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15"/>To tinde ere mor mane un-go mokwongo? Anyalo wacho ni kane alimou mokwongo, to ne urwaka gi mor maduongʼ ma kata mana wengeu ne unyalo miya. <verse eid="GAL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16"/>Dipo ni asedoko jasiku nikech awachonu adiera?<verse eid="GAL 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17"/>Jogo to ero temo ywayou korgi, to ngʼeuru ni gitimo kamano mana mar kethou. Gima gitemo timo en mana mondo gipogu kodwa, mondo gin ema umigi duongʼ moloyo wan. <verse eid="GAL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18"/>To onge wach, chiwruok gi mor ber abera, makmana ni nyaka utim kamano kuom timo gima ber. To dine ber moloyo kutimo kamano kinde duto, kata antie kata aonge. <verse eid="GAL 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19"/>Nyithinda mahero, awinjo rem mana ka dhako mamuoch kayo, ka agombo mondo Kristo onywol eiu. <verse eid="GAL 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20"/>To dobedo maber ka an kodu sani mondo awuo kodu wangʼ gi wangʼ eka uwinj dwonda maber, nimar chunya chandore ahinya nikech un.<verse eid="GAL 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hagar kod Sara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21"/>Nyisaneuru un joma dwaro bedo e bwo chik, donge ungʼeyo gima chik wacho? <verse eid="GAL 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22"/>Ungʼeyo ni nondiki ni Ibrahim ne nigi yawuowi ariyo, ma achiel kuomgi nonywol gi dhako ma misumba, to machielo to nonywol gi dhako ma thuolo. <verse eid="GAL 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23"/>Wuod dhako ma misumbano nonywol kuom dwaro mar dhano, to wuod dhako ma thuolo nonywol kuom singruok.<verse eid="GAL 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24"/>Tiend wechegi opondo, nikech mon ariyogi ochungʼ kar singruok ariyo. Singruok achiel oa Got Sinai, kendo onywolo nyithindo monego obed wasumbini: Ma en Hagar. <verse eid="GAL 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25"/>Hagar ochungʼ kar Got Sinai mantie e piny jo-Arabu, kendo godno chalo gi dala maduongʼ mar Jerusalem nikech osiko e tich misumba gi nyithinde nyaka kawuono. <verse eid="GAL 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26"/>To Jerusalem moger malo ni thuolo kendo en e minwa, <verse eid="GAL 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27"/>mana kaka ondiki ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“Bed mamor, in dhako ma migumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">in ma ok inywol nyithindo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">tingʼ dwondi malo ka igoyo koko gi ilo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">in mane muoch ok okayi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">nimar dhako ma migumba nobed gi nyithindo mangʼeny,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">moloyo dhako man-gi dichwo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Isa 54:1</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="GAL 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28"/>Kuom mano un owetena, un koro un nyithind singruok mana kaka Isaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29"/>To mana kaka e kindeno wuowi mane onywol kuom dwaro mar dhano nosando wuowi mane onywol gi teko mar Roho Maler, e kaka timore bende e kindeni. <verse eid="GAL 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30"/>Muma to wacho angʼo kuom wachni? Owacho niya, “Riemb dhako ma misumbani kod wuode nimar wuod dhako ma misumbani ok nobed jacham girkeni kaachiel gi wuod dhako ma ni thuoloni.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Chak 21:10</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31"/>Kuom mano owetena, ok wan nyithind dhako ma misumba, to wan koth dhako man thuolo.<verse eid="GAL 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Thuolo ma ngʼato nigo kuom Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1"/>Kristo nogonyowa mondo wabed joma ni thuolo. Omiyo chungʼuru motegno, kendo kik uyie tingʼ mapek kurwako jok mar wasumbini kendo.<verse eid="GAL 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2"/>Winjuru gima awachonu maber! An Paulo asiemou ni ka uyie mondo oteru nyangu, to bedo ja-Kristo ok nokonyu. <verse eid="GAL 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3"/>To bende awachonu ni ngʼato angʼata moter nyangu nigi gowi mar chopo Chike Musa mamoko duto. <verse eid="GAL 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4"/>In mitemo bet e winjruok gi Nyasaye kuom mako chik, ngʼeni isepogori gi Kristo; kendo isea kuom ngʼwono mar Nyasaye. <verse eid="GAL 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5"/>Wan to Roho ema miyo wabedo gi geno ni wabiro bedo e winjruok gi Nyasaye kuom yie. <verse eid="GAL 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6"/>Nikech kuom Kristo Yesu onge pogruok bed ni ngʼato oter nyangu kata ok otere. Gimoro achiel kende madwarore en yie matiyo kuom hera.<verse eid="GAL 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7"/>Jo-Galatia, yande uringo ngʼwech maber, en ngʼa moseduodou motamou luwo adiera? <verse eid="GAL 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8"/>Gima otimorenuno ok oa kuom Jal mane oluongou. <verse eid="GAL 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9"/>Ungʼeyo ngero mawacho niya, “Thowi matin ema miyo mogo modwal kuot.” <verse eid="GAL 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10"/>An gi geno kuom Ruoth ni ok ubi yie rwako paro moro mopogore moa kuom ngʼat machielo. To ngʼatno mosewitou gi puonj mobamno nyaka Nyasaye bi kume, kata bed ni en ngʼama nade. <verse eid="GAL 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11"/>Jowetena, kaponi pod ayalo wach tero nyangu, to ere gima omiyo pod isanda kama? Ka kamano to kare puonj ma apuonjo mar msalaba dine ok okelo chwanyruok. <verse eid="GAL 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12"/>Joma thagougo, to daher mondo gidhi nyime ka gitimo mano nyaka gihinyre kendgi giwegi!<verse eid="GAL 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13"/>Jowetena, Nyasaye noluongou mondo ubed thuolo. To kik uti gi thuolo ma un-go mondo utim timbe maricho ma ringreu gombo timo. Kar timo kamano, to ngʼato ka ngʼato onego kony nyawadgi kuom hera. <verse eid="GAL 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14"/>Nikech Chik duto ichopo kare mana gi chik achiel mawacho niya, “Her wadu kaka iherori iwuon.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lawi 19:18</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15"/>To ka ukaru kendo ukidhoru kendu mana ka ondiegi, to tangʼuru, nono to ubiro tiekoru.<verse eid="GAL 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngima kuom Roho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16"/>Omiyo akwayou ni mondo uwuothi kuom Roho, eka ok ubi timo gik ma ringreu dwaro. <verse eid="GAL 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17"/>Nikech ringruok osiko ka dwaro timo mana gik ma Roho ok dwar, to Roho bende dwaro chopo gik ma ringruok ok dwar. Gik moko ariyogi osiko ok winjre kendo mano ema miyo ok utim gik mabeyo mugombo timo. <verse eid="GAL 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18"/>To ka Roho ema otelonu, to koro ok un e bwo Chik.<verse eid="GAL 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19"/>Timbe mag ringruok nenore ratiro, gin kaka: chode, timbe mochido, anjawo, <verse eid="GAL 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20"/>lamo nyiseche manono, jwok, sigu, dhawo, nyiego, mirima, ichlit, miero; pogruok e kanyakla, <verse eid="GAL 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21"/>kod gombo; mer, dwanyruok, gi timbe mamoko mobam machal gi mago. To asiemou kaka nasiemou kinde motelo, ni joma timo timbe ma kamagi ok noyud gweth mar pinyruoth Nyasaye.<verse eid="GAL 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22"/>To gik ma Roho nyago gin hera, mor, kwe, horuok, ngʼwono, ber, bedo ja-adiera, <verse eid="GAL 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23"/>dimbruok kod ritruok. Onge chik moro amora makwedo gik ma kamago. <verse eid="GAL 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24"/>Jo-Kristo Yesu madier duto oseguro e msalaba kit dhano machon gi gombone duto kod dwarone. <verse eid="GAL 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25"/>Nikech wadak kuom Roho, wasikuru mana ka wawuotho kuom Roho. <verse eid="GAL 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26"/>Kik wawuondre kendwa wawegi, ka wasiko mana ka wakwinyore kendo wagombo gige jowadwa.<verse eid="GAL 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Timo maber ne ji duto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1"/>Jowetena, ka ojuk ngʼato katimo richo, to un joma nigi Roho onego uduoge gi chuny mamuol, kuritoru uwegi mondo kik udonj e tem. <verse eid="GAL 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2"/>Kawuru tingʼ mag jowadu, nikech kutimo kamano eka uchopo chik Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3"/>To ka ngʼato okawore moketore e duongʼ ma oongego, to ngʼatno wuondore owuon. <verse eid="GAL 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4"/>Ngʼato ka ngʼato nyaka non wuodhe owuon eka doyud gima dopakrego kuom tich maber mosetimo kik ipiem gi ngʼat machielo, <verse eid="GAL 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5"/>nimar ngʼato ka ngʼato nigi morome.<verse eid="GAL 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6"/>Ngʼat mipuonjo Kristo nyaka pogne japuonjne gik moko duto mabeyo.<verse eid="GAL 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7"/>Kik uwuondru kendu, Nyasaye ok nyal wuondi. Ngʼeuru gima ichwoyo ema ikayo. <verse eid="GAL 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8"/>Ngʼat ma ochwoyo kuom ringruok, noka kethruok, to ngʼat ma ochwoyo kuom Roho, noka ngima mochwere. <verse eid="GAL 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9"/>Omiyo kik waol gi timo timbe mabeyo, nikech ka ok waol to wabiro keyo, ka ndalo ochopo. <verse eid="GAL 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10"/>Emomiyo, e kinde duto mwayudoe thuolo, to ber mondo watim maber ni ji duto, to moloyo ni kanyakla mar joma oyie.<verse eid="GAL 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s1">Weche mogik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11"/>Neyeuru kaka lweta awuon ema ondikonu baruwani gi nukta madongo dongo!<verse eid="GAL 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12"/>Jogo madwaro nyisore kuom gik maokogo to temo chunou ni nyaka teru nyangu. To gimomiyo gitimo ma en mana ni mondo gitony e sand mochomogi nikech wach msalap Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13"/>Kata mana joma chunou mondo teru nyangu bende ok rit chik. Un to gichunou mondo giyud thuolo mar sungore nikech gima otim e ringre. <verse eid="GAL 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14"/>An to ok anyal sungora e ringruok ngangʼ. Gima dimi asungra en mana msalap Ruodhwa Yesu Kristo, mosemiyo piny kod dwarone ogur e ngimana. <verse eid="GAL 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15"/>Nikech kata bed ni ngʼato oter nyangu kata ok otere ok lich, to gima dwarore en ni ochwe ngʼato chwech manyien. <verse eid="GAL 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16"/>Kwe gi ngʼwono obed ni ji duto moyie luwo chikni, kendo kata ni Israel mar Nyasaye.<verse eid="GAL 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17"/>Mogik, kik ngʼato angʼata koro kelna chandruok, nimar ringra opongʼ gi mbelni ma aseyudo kaka jaote Yesu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18"/>Jowetena, mad ngʼwono mar Ruodhwa Yesu Kristo rit chunyu. Amin.<verse eid="GAL 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6"/>
</usx>
